Jettison_Data/Facts.lua (in the Jettison_Data folder, which a release ships beside Jettison). This
file is compiled from the CMaNGOS Classic content database (github.com/cmangos/classic-db), which
is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3, so this one file alone is distributed
under GPL-3.0 rather than the terms above. It also reads pfQuest's vanilla database
(github.com/shagu/pfQuest, MIT licensed) for area ids and nothing else. The full GPL-3.0 text is
in LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt and CMaNGOS's own copyright notice is in LICENSES/cmangos-COPYRIGHT.md.
Corresponding Source, as GPL-3.0 section 6(d) asks:
https://github.com/Rockjaw-Bonesnapper-Co/itemtree-era-sources (the compiler, the pinned inputs and
these notices). Everything else in Jettison, the rest of the Jettison_Data folder included, is all
rights reserved under the terms above.

